s=\"badge badge-secondary\">Best value</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\">$999</div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Rating 4.2 from 2,310 reviews</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <h2>Specifications</h2>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Key hardware and physical details for each model.</p>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Spec</th>\n          <th>Aero 14</th>\n          <th>Forge 16</th>\n          <th>Nimbus 13</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Price</td><td class=\"num\">$1,299</td><td class=\"num\">$1,899</td><td class=\"num\">$999</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Screen</td><td>14\" OLED</td><td>16\" IPS 165Hz</td><td>13\" IPS</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>CPU</td><td>8-core, 15 W</td><td>16-core, 55 W</td><td>6-core, 15 W</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>RAM</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td><td class=\"num\">32 GB</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">512 GB</td><td class=\"num\">1024 GB</td><td class=\"num\">256 GB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Weight</td><td class=\"num\">1.2 kg</td><td class=\"num\">2.1 kg</td><td class=\"num\">1.0 kg</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Battery</td><td class=\"num\">18 h</td><td class=\"num\">9 h</td><td class=\"num\">22 h</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Ports</td><td>2x USB-C, HDMI, headphone</td><td>2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, SD card</td><td>2x USB-C, headphone</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3>Battery life</h3>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3>Price</h3>\n  